{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_160_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_160","textTraditional":"一、十有一年。春王正月，作三軍。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_160_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_160","textTraditional":"三軍者何？三卿也。作三軍，何以書？譏。何譏爾？古者上卿、下卿，上士、下士。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_160_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_160","textTraditional":"二、夏四月，四卜郊不從，乃不郊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_160_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_160","textTraditional":"三、鄭公孫舍之帥師侵宋。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_160_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_160","textTraditional":"四、公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、曹伯、齊世子光、莒子、邾婁子、滕子、薛伯、〈木巳〉伯、小邾婁子伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_160_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_160","textTraditional":"五、秋七月己未，同盟于京城北。公至自伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_160_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_160","textTraditional":"六、楚子、鄭伯伐宋。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_160_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_160","textTraditional":"七、公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、曹伯、齊世子光、莒子、邾婁子、滕子、薛伯、〈木巳〉伯、小邾婁子伐鄭，會于蕭魚。公至自會。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_160_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_160","textTraditional":"此伐鄭也，其言會于蕭魚何？蓋鄭與會爾。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_160_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_160","textTraditional":"八、楚人執鄭行人良霄。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_160_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_160","textTraditional":"九、冬，秦人伐晉。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}